cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - name: RakTikoo
title: "adifcheck: check a ham-radio ADIF log's contents before you upload it"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-18
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/adifcheck"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/adifcheck"
abstract: >-
  Checks the contents of a ham-radio ADIF log — the values LoTW and eQSL
  actually reject — before upload: submodes in the MODE field,
  band/frequency disagreement, satellite contacts with no propagation mode,
  invalid dates, and more, against the ADIF 3.1.8 specification.
keywords:
  - ADIF
  - ham radio
  - LoTW
  - amateur radio
  - log checking
